<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Sonae Q1 results next week.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Sonae Q1 results next week.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sonae group will issue results for the first quarter of 1997 on Thursday or Friday of next week, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
